# Run artifacts are local by default — they are large and mostly scratch.
# reports/hk/ is the exception: it is the committed Haiku validation board that the
# PM layer replays, so it is versioned deliberately (~70 MB, 88 files).
# reports/hkpm/ is the PM-layer experiment run on that board, versioned for the
# same reason.
reports/*
!reports/hk/
!reports/sn/
!reports/hkpm/
.DS_Store
.claude/
results/anonymize/llm_cache/
results/pm/llm_cache/
